WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.475
For each in-scope device,
the kit runs these checks.

2
00:00:03.475 --> 00:00:05.712
Real-time and tamper protection on.

3
00:00:05.712 --> 00:00:08.300
The antivirus in normal, active mode.

4
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:11.568
Network protection and
controlled folder access

5
00:00:11.568 --> 00:00:14.525
at the ring's stage from
the plan, block or audit.

6
00:00:14.525 --> 00:00:18.274
On servers, network protection
allowed on the server;

7
00:00:18.274 --> 00:00:21.512
and on high-UDP roles,
datagram processing off.

8
00:00:21.512 --> 00:00:24.999
And each firewall profile
on, with inbound blocked.

9
00:00:24.999 --> 00:00:27.319
It runs the guide's event query too,

10
00:00:27.319 --> 00:00:31.625
and writes the device checks, the
drift, the events and a summary.

11
00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:35.201
Moving a ring from audit to block
is a change to the plan file,

12
00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:38.850
under the same change record
that changes the Intune policy.

13
00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:40.970
The kit never changes a policy.
